<%- include('partials/public-header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1>Your AI commerce assistant for chat-first selling</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Tovila replies to customers instantly, captures orders accurately, and
      knows when to bring you in — so you stop typing the same answers over
      and over and start closing more sales.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/signup" class="btn-primary">Start free trial</a>
      <a href="/login" class="btn-secondary">Log in</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-fineprint">7 days free, no card required.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual">
    <img src="/mascot.svg" alt="" class="hero-mascot" />
    <%- include('partials/chat-mockup') %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-grid" id="features">
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon icon-primary">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-4 4V5Z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>Replies in the customer's own words</h3>
    <p>English, Swahili, Sheng, or a natural mix — Tovila replies in whichever language the customer used, instantly, 24/7.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon icon-accent">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="17" rx="2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M9 3h6v3H9V3Z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2 2 4-4.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>Order capture &amp; tracking</h3>
    <p>Every order gets recorded automatically — item, quantity, delivery location, customer details — with a status you update as you fulfill it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon icon-danger">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none"><path d="M12 3 2 20h20L12 3Z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M12 10v4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1" fill="#fff"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>Knows when to bring you in</h3>
    <p>Complaints, custom pricing requests, or genuine uncertainty get flagged to you directly, with a notification — Tovila never guesses on your behalf.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon icon-tertiary">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none"><path d="M4 20V10M12 20V4M20 20v-7" stroke="#1C1C1E" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>A real dashboard, not spreadsheets</h3>
    <p>See what needs your attention, orders to prepare, and real reporting on conversations, response time, and sales activity — all in one place.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="steps" id="how-it-works">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">1</div>
      <h3>Connect your number</h3>
      <p>Link the WhatsApp number your customers already message.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">2</div>
      <h3>Add your catalog &amp; FAQs</h3>
      <p>Products, prices, delivery fees, and common questions — Tovila only ever answers from what you give it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">3</div>
      <h3>Let Tovila handle the chats</h3>
      <p>Customers get instant, accurate replies. You get orders ready to fulfill and a heads-up whenever something needs you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="compare">
  <h2>Why not just reply yourself?</h2>
  <div class="compare-table">
    <div class="compare-col compare-col-tovila">
      <div class="compare-head"><img src="/logo.svg" alt="Tovila" /></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Availability</strong><span>Instant replies, 24/7</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Languages</strong><span>English, Swahili, Sheng, mixed</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Orders</strong><span>Captured automatically, ready to fulfill</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Tricky messages</strong><span>Flagged to you, never guessed</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Reporting</strong><span>Real dashboard &amp; charts</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-col">
      <div class="compare-head compare-head-muted">Manual DMs</div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Availability</strong><span>Whenever you're free to type</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Languages</strong><span>Whatever you personally speak</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Orders</strong><span>Scribbled in a notebook or lost in chat</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Tricky messages</strong><span>You handle everything yourself</span></div>
      <div class="compare-row"><strong>Reporting</strong><span>None</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="coming-soon">
  <p><strong>Live today:</strong> WhatsApp and Instagram. <strong>Coming soon:</strong> TikTok — the same assistant, wherever your customers message you.</p>
</section>

<section class="pricing-teaser">
  <h2>KES 1,000/month, one simple plan</h2>
  <p>Every feature included. 7-day free trial, no card required.</p>
  <a href="/pricing" class="btn-secondary">See pricing</a>
</section>

<%- include('partials/public-footer') %>
